  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Циановое главное действие для явного запуска операции.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\" type=\"button\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m8 4 12 8-12 8V4Z\"/></svg>Сгенерировать спектр</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong,#506976);border-radius:var(--radius-control,6px);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color var(--duration,160ms),border-color var(--duration,160ms),color var(--duration,160ms);font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Golos Text\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);background:var(--accent,#67d5db);color:var(--accent-ink,#102b31);border-color:var(--accent,#67d5db);font-weight:600}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-hover,#92e5e9);border-color:var(--accent-hover,#92e5e9)}.ds-button-primary:active{background:var(--accent,#67d5db)}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#67d5db);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Плоское вторичное действие на приподнятом графите.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-secondary\" type=\"button\">Обновить очереди</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong,#506976);border-radius:var(--radius-control,6px);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color var(--duration,160ms),border-color var(--duration,160ms),color var(--duration,160ms);font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Golos Text\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);background:var(--surface-raised,#20323c);color:var(--ink,#e4edf1)}.ds-button-secondary:hover{background:var(--surface-hover,#263b46);border-color:var(--subtle,#91a9b6)}.ds-button-secondary:active{background:var(--input,#111e26)}.ds-button-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#67d5db);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-button-secondary:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-secondary{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Input field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Подпись над утопленным полем; циановый клавиатурный фокус.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Название очереди<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Название\" value=\"Спектры образца\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:7px;min-width:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted,#a7b8c2);font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Golos Text\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);}.ds-input{width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border-strong,#506976);border-radius:var(--radius-control,6px);background:var(--input,#111e26);color:var(--ink,#e4edf1);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;caret-color:var(--accent,#67d5db);font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Golos Text\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--subtle,#91a9b6)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#67d5db);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-field:has(.ds-input:disabled){color:var(--subtle,#91a9b6)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation item",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item",
      "description": "Название, подпись и контурная пиктограмма; активность выделяется тоном и циановой пиктограммой.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-navigation\" aria-label=\"Основная навигация\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"/analysis\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 18h3l3-7 3 5 4-12 3 14h2M3 21h18\"/></svg><span>Анализ спектра<small>Сигнал и элементы</small></span></a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"/generator\"><span>Генератор<small>Синтетические образцы</small></span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-navigation{display:grid;gap:5px;max-width:218px;background:var(--rail,#10191f);padding:16px;font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Golos Text\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);}.ds-nav-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:13px 10px;min-height:64px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:7px;color:var(--muted,#a7b8c2);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55}.ds-nav-item small{display:block;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px;color:var(--subtle,#91a9b6)}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--surface,#18262d);color:var(--ink,#e4edf1)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--surface-raised,#20323c);color:var(--ink,#e4edf1);border-color:var(--border,#30434e)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current=\"page\"]>svg{color:var(--accent,#67d5db);flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#67d5db);outline-offset:4px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status tag",
